# Captain Marvel. (Activate each power-up ability only once. Reduce the cost by her mana cost if she entered this
# turn.)" Bot1 casts her with five white mana, then activates power-up the same turn with Sol Ring's {C}{C} alone: her
# {3}{W}{W} takes the {W}{W} off the white of {5}{W}{W} and {3} off its generic mana, leaving {2} (CR 702.193a-b, 118.7),
# which colorless pays and which takes the whole of the {C}{C}. Had only generic mana come off, the {W}{W} would be
# left to pay and Sol Ring could not. Once it has resolved, she has both counters, and with Mana Crypt's {C}{C} still to
# spend the ability is not offered again: activate only once.

